---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact
bodyClass: page-contact
description: Get in touch with Lexi Zotomayor.
---

<div class="page-hero container">
  <div class="section-label">Contact</div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Get in Touch</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">Have a project in mind, a question, or just want to say hello?</p>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container contact-page">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-info">
        <h2>Let's talk</h2>
        <p>I'm always open to hearing about interesting projects, collaborations, or new opportunities. Don't hesitate to reach out.</p>

        <div class="contact-methods">
          <div class="contact-method">
            <span class="contact-method-label">Email</span>
            <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-method">
            <span class="contact-method-label">GitHub</span>
            <a href="{{ site.social.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@lexizotomayor</a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-method">
            <span class="contact-method-label">LinkedIn</span>
            <a href="{{ site.social.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lexi Zotomayor</a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-method">
            <span class="contact-method-label">Twitter</span>
            <a href="{{ site.social.twitter }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@lexizotomayor</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-cta-box">
        <p class="contact-cta-label">Ready to start a conversation?</p>
        <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Send me an email &rarr;</a>
        <p class="contact-response-note">I typically respond within 1–2 business days.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
